.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-GRAPH 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-graph \- Create, label, list, import, freeze and thaw named graphs and overlays
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu graph\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create, label, list, import, freeze and thaw named graphs and overlays
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-graph\-create(1)
Register a committed named graph
.TP
quipu\-graph\-label(1)
Declare lattice labels on a registered graph
.TP
quipu\-graph\-list(1)
List registered named graphs
.TP
quipu\-graph\-import(1)
Import another store file as a named graph
.TP
quipu\-graph\-freeze(1)
Freeze a graph\*(Aqs full history into a read\-only archive pack
.TP
quipu\-graph\-thaw(1)
Restore a frozen graph from its archive pack
.TP
quipu\-graph\-overlay\-create(1)
Create an overlay graph bound to a committed parent
.TP
quipu\-graph\-overlay\-write(1)
Assert, retract or tombstone a triple in an overlay
.TP
quipu\-graph\-overlay\-compose(1)
Resolve an overlay\*(Aqs composed view over its parent
.TP
quipu\-graph\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
